    "description": "### Impact\nPrevent stored cross-site scripting (XSS) in the admin interface by ensuring staff action log values are properly escaped before rendering. The fix modifies the staff action log model to treat previous and new value fields as plain text rather than trusted HTML.\n\n### Patches\nUpgrade to the patched version.\n\n### Workarounds\nUpgrade to the patched version.",
